             "getaircraftupgradecomponent",
             "the upgrade component is aircraft. upgrade this component when gimbal, battery, flight  controller and other internal modules' firmware versions are inconsistent. it is only  supported by mavic air, mavic 2 series.  @return an object of `upgradecomponent`.",
             "getremotecontrollerupgradecomponent",
             "the upgrade component is remote controller. upgrade this component when its internal  modules' firmware versions are inconsistent. it is only supported by mavic 2 series.  @return an object of `upgradecomponent`.",
             "upgradecomponent",
             "this class is used to control components' upgrade. it also provides methods to receive  firmware consistency upgrade state and the latest firmware version information. it is  only supported by mavic air, mavic 2 series, matrice 300 rtk.",
             "getcomponenttype",
             "component to upgrade.  @return an enum value of `upgradecomponenttype`.",
             "getindex",
             "returns the upgrade component index. index is zero based.  please refer to `getindex` to get the component index. for instance, if matrice 300 rtk can have three gimbal mounted cameras, the three camera components are with indices 0, 1 and 4.  @return an int value of index.",
             "getupgradestate",
             "current firmware upgrade state.  @return an enum value of `upgradefirmwarestate`.",
             "getlatestfirmwareinformation",
             "the latest firmware information.  @return an enum value of `firmwareinformation`.",
             "addupgradefirmwarelistener",
             "adds a listener to receive the `upgradefirmwarelistener`..  @param listener listener to receive the `upgradefirmwarelistener`..  it is used to distinguish different listener and the listener will be retained.",
