             "updates the logged-in user's activation state for dji flighthub. this method is only valid when the user  is logged in. when the state is updated, the state will be cached to `isuseractivated`. please invoke the `authorizeaccesstodjidevicehardwareinfo` to authorize dji server to access dji device's hardware information.  @param callback the execution callback with the returned execution result.",
