             "get a bounding box for the target. the rectangle is normalized to [0,1] where (0,0) is the top left of  the video preview and (1,1) is the bottom right. when send target rect to vision system, it will  recognize the target and push modified target bounding box. value is available if  the `getcurrentstate`  is `recognizing_target`,  `waiting_for_confirmation`,  `measuring_target`.  @return an object of rectf",
