             "sdk key for getdetectionsectors: the vision system can see in front of the aircraft with a 70 degree horizontal field of view (fov) and 55-degree  vertical fov for the phantom 4. the horizontal fov is split into four equal sectors and this array contains the distance and warning information for each sector. for phantom 4, the horizontal fov is separated into 4 sectors.  @return an instance of list<djivisiondetectionsector>. ",
