             "level_2_cell_voltage_behavior",
             "sdk key for setlevel2cellvoltagebehavior: sets the operation that will be executed when the cell voltage crosses under level 2 threshold. it can only be set when motors are off.  @param behavior level 2 behavior. @param callback asynchronous execution result callback.",
             "getlevel2cellvoltagebehavior",
