             "sdk key for setselfdischargeindays: smart batteries can be setup to automatically discharge over a custom period of time. this method sets the battery's self discharge period in days with range [1, 10]. for inspire 2 and m200 series products, the max range value can be 20. not supported by mavic air 2, dji air 2s, non-smart batteries, spark and the osmo series.  @param days day for self-discharge @param callback asynchronous execution result callback.",
             "getselfdischargeindays",
             "smart batteries can be setup to automatically discharge over a custom period of time. this method gets the battery's self discharge period in days with range [1, 10]. for inspire 2 and m200 series products, the max range value can be 20. not supported by non-smart batteries and the osmo series.  @param callback asynchronous execution result callback that contains the number of days to discharge over.",
