                   "setISO",
                   2,
                   "/Components/Camera/DJICamera.html",
                   "#DJICamera_CameraSettings_setISO_inline",
                   "Sets the camera's ISO value. See `ISO` to view all possible ISO settings for the camera. For the X5, X5R, Phantom 4 Pro camera, X4S and X5S, the ISO value can be set for all modes. For the other cameras, the ISO value can only be set when the camera exposure mode is in Manual mode. See the `setExposureMode` method for how to set exposure mode. For Mavic 2 Enterprise Dual, the ISO value is always `AUTO`. For Zenmuse H20 Series and Mavic 2 Enterprise Advanced, please use class `Lens`.  @param iso The ISO value to set the camera to use. Please check the enum CameraISOe in DJICameraSettingsDef to find all possible ISO values that the camera can be set to. @param callback The execution callback with the returned execution result.",
