                   "#DJICamera_ThermalCamera_setThermalPalette_inline",
                   "Sets the Palette. Each palette is a unique look-up table that maps 8-bit temperature values to different colors. Different palettes can be used to help the user better visualize temperature contrast or specific temperature bands. The valid range can be fetched from `thermalPaletteRange`. Supported only by thermal imaging cameras. For Zenmuse H20T and H20N, please use class `Lens`.  @param palette An enum type of the `ThermalPalette` to be used. @param callback The execution callback with the returned execution result.",
