                   "#DJIRTK_setReferenceStationSource_inline",
                   "Sets the reference station source that provides real-time corrections for the RTK air system. It is only supported by Phantom 4 RTK. For Matrice 210 RTK, Matrice 600 series and Mavic 2 Enterprise Advanced, the reference station is always the physical base station.  @param source Reference station source to set. @param callback The completion block that receives the result.",
